con__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My character is a sorcerer. He fights using The Burning Name, which is an Intelligence + Occult attack, but acts as a Ranged attack so gets a Thrown style accuracy modifier. Additionally, I have a specialty is magical flame attacks, so I get to add that to my attack roll. I'd love a sheet that can handle those kinds of numbers, even if it's a manual &quot;I want to add +1 to this attack pool all the time&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Problem should be solved, may you test it and send your feedback please ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Craft (Excel) <b>x x</b> <b>x</b> o o<br /> Craft (IKEA) <b>x x </b>o o o<br /> Socialize o o o o o (= geek)","edited":{"userid":13356,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13356-yoyoda76","user":"Yoyoda76","date":". 05-10-2017, 03:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13356-yoyoda76","name":"Yoyoda76","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-14T13:42:03-07:00","id":1092469,"title":"","content":"Changelog (v0.94)<br /> - Nicer help on the sides<br /> - Fixed broken Bonus Points Calculation<br /> - the links now always point to the latest version","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http: