ed/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-30T10:25:31-07:00","id":1098469,"title":"","content":"Hi Refhi. First off, AWESOME work on this. It's a very handy tool for helping to work out characters. As someone just learning the system, it really, really helped.<br /> <br /> In hopes of helping improve what you've done, I have two bugs and a suggestion.<br /> <br /> Bug 1: If you have the Giant Merit, the extra Health level is not reflected on your sheet.<br /> Bug 2: If you have an Artifact Weapon or Armor, the Attunement costs are only reflected in the Creation1 tab and do not carry over to BP or XP tabs. They are not reflected on the final output, either.<br /> Suggestion: If you have an Artifact Weapon with both Melee and Thrown tags (such as an Axe) there is no way to list it as both Melee and Thrown without it charging you Attunement twice. Perhaps a checkbox to override the cost for a duplicate entry of that sort?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13522-fyndhal","name":"Fyndhal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-05T12:38:46-07:00","id":1100531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fyndhal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1098469#post1098469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi Refhi. First off, AWESOME work on this. It's a very handy tool for helping to work out characters. As someone just learning the system, it really, really helped.<br /> <br /> In hopes of helping improve what you've done, I have two bugs and a suggestion.<br /> <br /> Bug 1: If you have the Giant Merit, the extra Health level is not reflected on your sheet.<br /> Bug 2: If you have an Artifact Weapon or Armor, the Attunement costs are only reflected in the Creation1 tab and do not carry over to BP or XP tabs. They are not reflected on the final output, either.<br /> Suggestion: If you have an Artifact Weapon with both Melee and Thrown tags (such as an Axe) there is no way to list it as both Melee and Thrown without it charging you Attunement twice. Perhaps a checkbox to override the cost for a duplicate entry of that sort?</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you very much for your feedback. Glad our work helps a bit ^^<br /> <br /> I've fixed the bugs and implemented your suggestion : if you have two line with the same artefact (i.e. the same name) the attunement cost will only be taken once. If you have other feedback or suggestions please let us know :-)<br /> <br /> <br /> Changelog (v0.98)<br /> - Added flaws and supernatural merits<br /> - Fixed scalable lines in _XP<br /> - Fixed Attunement Cost calculation<br /> - Reworked completely the Health Lvl calculation, and now Giant Reflect properly on them<br /> <br /> /!\\ Version is now v0.98, be sure it's shown on the Welcome tab. If not empty your browser cache /!\\","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T03:26:45-07:00","id":1101163,"title":"","content":"Hi, first of all this looks really good. But it would be nice if you had space to specify lore ability. Like with craft since the rulebook says you have to select which field of lore you are studying. I had to implement this midway into my own campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13232-sungamer","name":"Sungamer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T06:03:41-07:00","id":1101190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sungamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1101163#post1101163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi, first of all this looks really good. But it would be nice if you had space to specify lore ability. Like with craft since the rulebook says you have to select which field of lore you are studying. I had to implement this midway into my own campaign.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unlike with Craft, though, you only ever have a single Lore rating.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T08:27:49-07:00","id":1101236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morangias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1101190#post1101190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unlike with Craft, though, you only ever have a single Lore rating.</div> </div> </div> </div>True but you still have to indicate what areas of expertise in lore you have studied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T12:02:40-07:00","id":1101319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>armyofwhispers</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1101236#post1101236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True but you still have to indicate what areas of expertise in lore you have studied.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hurm... My fist answer would have been &quot;use specialties&quot;, but &quot;Lore areas o