ss=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying this out for the first time, using the LibreOffice version (in LibreOffice). For some reason, when I try to increase the dot values, like Attributes or Abilities, it isn't showing. If I click Up four or five times, it grays out and only Down is available, so it's counting, but visually it's not showing the dots. What's going on?<br /> <br /> I initially hoped that this would work in Open Office, and I tried that first, and the dot counter was working there, but the references weren't. Sigh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for your feedback, <br /> <br /> Can you send me more details? <br /> - sheet version (v1. 04?) <br /> - OS (I have seen some issues with Linux and Mac) <br /> - libreoffice version? <br /> - did you save the file on disk before editing? <br /> <br /> And if possible could you please send me the file you edited (I'll PM my email if you want)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":13355,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","user":"Refhi","date":". 08-14-2017, 04:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link