ter what your answer and you're under no obligation to make such a sheet to appease me :-P)</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohhhhhhhhh Shiny Ideas here... And to think I am currently making a BeastMaster and did not think about that...<br /> <br /> Now I definitely want to make that sheet.<br /> <br /> Though you're the one who gave the idea so could you help me on this? (if anyone is interested please share your thoughts as well) <br /> <br /> Here are a few questions :<br /> - wich size should it be? (A5? A4?)<br /> - included or appart from the current sheet?<br /> - what should we see on it?<br /> - Quick Caracter or Attributes &amp; Abilities? Both?<br /> - Dedicated Thread ?<br /> - have you seen the battle group generator? (here <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1110138-more-excel-libreoffice-nonsense-yay\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-nonsense-yay</a>) would you wait for something looking like that or more like a regular Character Sheet?<br /> - if you or someone else ever did a sheet for a familiar? What did it look like? (pm me a picture?)<br /> - do you want to participate in the database? (tedious work...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a