to participate in the database? (tedious work...)</div> </div> </div> </div>I could prob help some.<br /> <br /> -I'd say A4<br /> -Prob separate from the current sheet.<br /> -We prob need important combat and utility stuff. Also I'd say some place for merits and any kind of special abilities conferred with Solar training. Also a running tally on xp invested in a familiar.<br /> -I'd say both since you can train up individual attribute and abilities but the quick dice pools are super handy in combat and whatnot.<br /> -Dedicated thread might not be a bad idea.<br /> -I have not no. Maybe a mix of the two?<br /> -I came to you first to see if you had done a sheet for it.<br /> -I could prob contribute to DB work somewhat. I don't have a huge amount of free time but I can do some.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":8804,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","user":"armyofwhispers","date":". 09-08-2017, 10:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T18:03:21-07:00","id":1140685,"title":"","content":"Wanted to ask if there are any plans to add the charms from Miracles to the selection?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11320-gigaton-falcon-emu","name":"Gigaton-Falcon-Emu","avatar":"data:i