 there a field to input the xp you have? I'm looking on the creation_xp tab, and I don't have a location to add xp, and when I try to spend to auto-calc it? I get a null value. I might be missing something. Is there some place to do this? <br /> <br /> Currently using excel v16.0.8625.2121. <br /> <br /> Thank you again!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/238-hammerofheaven","name":"HammerofHeaven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar238_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-03T12:43:39-08:00","id":1164852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HammerofHeaven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1164779#post1164779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello! I absolutely love this sheet! Thank you for it! quick question though, is there a field to input the xp you have? I'm looking on the creation_xp tab, and I don't have a location to add xp, and when I try to spend to auto-calc it? I get a null value. I might be missing something. Is there some place to do this?<br /> <br /> Currently using excel v16.0.8625.2121.<br /> <br /> Thank you again!</div> </div> </div> </div>Hey,<br /> <br /> thanks a lot for your feedback, really means a lot to us.<br /> <br /> I have trouble understanding the problem you face : you can input your unspent XP in Creation_XP!AC37 and Total XP in Creation_XP!AH37 (which is use to calculate your Essence lvl).<br /> <br /> As I'm affraid this might not answer your question. Could you email me the sheet you made so I can take a look ? A screenshot with annotations would be nice as well. (I'm PM-ing you my adress)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-04T13:29:42-08:00","id":1165127,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Simon Darkstep</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1116929-now-hiring-spreadheet-nuts-for-900-charms-descriptions?p=1165010#post1165010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar13355_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13355\" data-vbnamecard=\"13355\">Refhi</a> - I was checking out your Excel character sheet since we got to posting in this thread. Pretty amazing work! Are you making it as only for character generation or also as a play sheet?<br /> <br /> I tend to build play sheets in particular, since laptops are common at my game table. Your design work is better than mine. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I do have some dice-rolling functions, and I tend to make a lot of scripting. I was working on an initiative tracker, but it's still pretty ugly. An Exalted dice pool manager &amp; roller sounds like a good crunchy project too.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you don't mind I move the conversation here <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> The design (and many smooth formulas) are mainly the work of <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13356-yoyoda76\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"13356\" data-vbnamecard=\"13356\">Yoyoda76</a> a friend of mine. Thanks for the compliments <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> For now the sheet is only for character generation and upgrading with xp. I thought about adding rolling features but the sheet is already very heavy (so much rules and databases <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />) that I fear adding more features. Though... we could imagine adding a tab for that... dammit. Stop increasing my todolist, please ^^<br /> <br /> (By the way, I'm a bit allergic to scripting, I always try not to use them as a rule, I find the result more sturdy, but that's only my opinion).<br /> <br /> That say I tried a dice roller/initiative counter on <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">http://refhi.free.fr/</a> if you want to take a look.<br /> <br /> You might find this interesting if you're laptop intensive : when one of our player is away he plays through discord with this bot : <a href=\"https://discordapp.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=207977122462040064&amp;scope=bot&amp;permissions=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://discordapp.com/oauth2/author...&amp;permissions=0</a> pretty nifty ! (allows to .roll dices, reroll, double TN &amp; stuff).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-04T13:47:05-08:00","id":1165129,"title":"","content":"Scripting in Excel gets gross, yes. It's a lot better if you turn off the application updating during number crunching. <br /> <br /> My plan right now for my own gaming group, is to see if we can get individual Ex3 combat turns to about two minutes, when we're all used to the system. (I'm not counting learning curve time!) That way, even with 5 players it's no more than about 10 minutes around the table. <br /> <br /> Our Ex2 game essentially died the night it took 45 minutes to get everybody a turn around the table -- attack, counterattack, huge piles of counting beads.... Our Werewolf game became immortalized the night we had about 45 second turns and three players. <br /> <br /> We have to manage Initiative, Essence (two pools), Health, Willpower, Defense (two ways), and Soak. And sometimes Anima. And we have to catch rerolls, X-agains, yatzee rolls, and all kinds of stuff. If anything is going to veto our (maybe upcoming) Ex3 game, this will be it.<br /> <br /> Excel will surely be part of that effort, because I'm pretty good with it. But we'll probably also be using the piles of counting beads again, and maybe a magnetic board or something. We'll see how it plays out! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1188890-momentum-exalted\" target=\"_blank\">Momentum Exalted!</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6192-simon-darkstep","name":"Simon Darkstep","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-09T13:09:58-08:00","id":1166325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HammerofHeaven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1164779#post1164779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello! I absolutely love this sheet! Thank you for it! quick question though, is there a field to input the xp you have? I'm looking on the creation_xp tab, and I don't have a location to add xp, and when I try to spend to auto-calc it? I get a null value. I might be missing something. Is there some place to do this?<br /> <br /> Currently using excel v16.0.8625.2121.<br /> <br /> Thank you again!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for sending the sheet, I just realise the terms I used are quite confusing :-|<ul><li>The &quot;Spent XP Declared&quot; is just the sum from both your total XP wich you're meant to input manually in the relevant blue cells. I'll have to rename that to make it clearer.</li> <li>The &quot;Total Spent (Autocalc)&quot; is totaly different : it's just a tool to help you count how much xp you're spreading on your sheet in Creation_XP, and by no mean a reliable xp tracking device (there's so many way to tweak xp attributes charms and stuff that it would be a Nightmare to take everything into account). I have to make it clearer.</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br /> So Todolist :<br /> - make Creation_XP Tutoriel clearer<br /> - add a way to manually input spent XP in the xp autocalc<br /> <br /> <br /> On a separate note, I find seeing sheet made with this tool very informative about the way it's being used.<br /> <br /> <b>I'll be glad if any user can send me their sheet</b> (xlsx ods or pdf) so I can take a peak, please link it here or PM it to me (I'll send my email if you can't link it to external storage service like dropbox or googlevildoc)<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T09:38:41-08:00","id":1166480,"title":"","content":"Changelog v1.20<ul><li>xp tweaker for unusual xp expenditure (buying a pet, Flowing M