 welcome so I can hunt those pesky bugs.<br /> <br /> <br /> To-do :<ul><li>DB Charm Database</li> <li>auto-select charm selection by Charm Prerequisite (loads of works...)</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>French Exalt &amp; ST &amp; ToolMaker [<a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/\" target=\"_blank\">Website</a>]<br /> Advanced Character Generator <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator#post1087290\" target=\"_blank\">Thread, </a><a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.xlsx\" target=\"_blank\">Excel Version</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Fiche%20perso%20colab.ods\" target=\"_blank\">LibreOffice Version</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141199-exalted-3-familiar-generator\" target=\"_blank\">Familiar Generator Thread</a> &amp; <a href=\"http://refhi.free.fr/exalted3/Familiar%20Generator.ods\" target=\"_blank\">Libreoffice Version</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13355-refhi","name":"Refhi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13355_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T12:50:54-07:00","id":1230899,"title":"","content":"I love this tool, but I noticed yesterday that the current version seems to have some mismatching between Solar charm types and their actual list. <br /> Steps to reproduce: <br /> Excel 365, V1.4 9Dragon Blooded Friendly!)<br /> Open a blank sheet<br /> Scroll immediately to Charms<br /> Select Ability: Presence<br /> Allow subtype autofill<br /> The list of charms goes from <br /> Empty Mind Strike (Martial Arts -&gt; Steel Devil Style) -&gt; Healer's Unerring Hands (medicine)<br /> <br /> Looks like the database may have been moved around from previous versions and not updated, or something? There's some sort of offset that starts as early as Craft (the first charm in Craft is currently Empowered Barter Stance) and as far as I can tell with limited time to test, this doesn't fix when you determine an exalt type and caste. Hope this helps, because, again, &lt;3 this tool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24023-bestcasesurvival","name":"BestCaseSurvival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24023_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T13:15:15-07:00","id":1230908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BestCaseSurvival</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1087290-advanced-character-generator?p=1230899#post1230899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love this tool, but I noticed yesterday that the current version seems to have some mismatching between Solar charm types and their actual list. <br /> Steps to reproduce: <br /> Excel 365, V1.4 9Dragon Blooded Friendly!)<br /> Open a blank sheet<br /> Scroll immediately to Charms<br /> Select Ability: Presence<br /> Allow subtype autofill<br /> The list of charms goes from <br /> Empty Mind Strike (Martial Arts -&gt; Steel Devil Style) -&gt; Healer's Unerring Hands (medicine)<br /> <br /> Looks like the databa